          <span class="gatex-field"><b></b><b></b><b></b></span>
          <span class="gatex-pillar"></span>
        </div>
        <span class="gatex-gatelabel">Gate reads every EPC</span>
      </div>

      <div class="gatex-step">
        <span class="gatex-cap">03 &middot; Outcome</span>
        <div class="gatex-out is-pass">
          <i class="ti ti-volume-off"></i>
          <div><strong>On the list</strong><span>Passes silently. No false alarm.</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="gatex-out is-flag">
          <i class="ti ti-alert-triangle"></i>
          <div><strong>Not on the list</strong><span>Flagged, with the EPC and the time.</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <ul class="gatex-notes">
          <li><i class="ti ti-check"></i> Works with Checkpoint, Sensormatic, and other gate providers via API</li>
          <li><i class="ti ti-check"></i> Bag Check: every EPC verified against the receipt at the exit</li>
