          <div class="mini-ico"><i class="ti ti-antenna"></i></div>
          <h3>Adjustable antenna power</h3>
          <p>Scale the reader from low to high power: pinpoint one item on a rack, or sweep an entire room.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rfp-card">
          <div class="mini-ico"><i class="ti ti-radar-2"></i></div>
          <h3>Hot-and-cold finder</h3>
          <p>A proximity meter tracks how close the reader is to a specific item, walking an associate to stock that has gone missing on the floor.</p>
        </div>
